            {
              "id": "w-bd75caa2da",
              "type": "rich_text",
              "name": "Text",
              "props": {
                "html": "<p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151\">Hi {{first_name}}, a refinance may be worth exploring when your goals or finances change. The right comparison includes closing costs, the new payment, and how long you plan to keep the loan.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold\">What would you most like a refinance to help you do?</p>",
                "align": "left"
